flowchart TD
    Main[Actual main scene] --> Session[Existing shared GameSession]
    Main --> Shell[One command shell]
    Shell --> Help[Optional fixed heading and Close]
    Help --> Scroll[Bounded scroll body]
    Scroll --> Guide[One scene-owned guidance panel]
    Session --> Bind[Bind once; clear on replacement]
    Bind --> Guide
    Events[Committed state / logistics / visibility] --> Dirty[Dirty; finite deferred visible read]
    Dirty --> Guide
    Hidden[Closed help] --> Defer[Dirty only; zero guide reads]
    Guide --> Action[One navigation String]
    Action --> Existing[Existing main deferred destination]
    Existing --> Preserve[Retain selected context and unsubmitted drafts]
    Existing --> Train[Training primary instructor hire control]
    Close[Close / reopen] --> Help
    Replace[Simulation replacement / exit] --> Guard[Clear stale action; current session; disconnect on exit]
    Guard --> Guide
    Owners[Physical services retain goods / people / claims / intent] -. Read only .-> Guide
